From 9e4fb7935aae745eb35704a02021ea8e7eeab140 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: J P <1953637+jpwatters@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 20:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 31/54] Project PDF for v2.0.2-NAS

Built by tools/nas-kit/doc/build_pdf.py from project.md, the folder's git
history (change history) and its code (listings), so it names the release it
describes. Section 9, "Keeping up with upstream: what each release changed",
lists for every port from v1.20.5 to v2.0.2 what stopped the patches and how
it was resolved (v2.0.2: upstream took settings bits 161 and 162, so the
relay's is 163). Section 8 describes QMX Bridge, the native Mac app with its
DriverKit virtual USB serial port; its code is listed in section 14.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01W7MAsxUnuCnfwkHxdqp61S
